              "text": "70",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho abandi ku bakulu b'endhu dha baiseibwe baaghaayo ebintu eby'okukola omulimo ogw'okuzimba. Omufuzi w'omu kiketezo ekyo yaaghaayo: kilo munaana (8) edha zaabu, n'ebbakuli amakumi ataanu (50), n'ebivaalo bya bakabona ebikumi bitaanu n'asatu (530). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.70",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.70"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "71",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:71"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "71",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'abandi ku bakulu b'endhu dha baiseibwe baaghaayo: kilo kikumi na nkaaga na munaana (168) edha zaabu, ni kilo lukumi na bibiri n'ataanu (1,250) edha feeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.71",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.71"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "72",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:72"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "72",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu boonaboona abaasigalagho baaghaayo: kilo kikumi na nkaaga na munaana (168) edha zaabu, ni kilo kikumi n'ana (140) edha feeza, n'ebivaalo bya bakabona nkaaga na musanvu (67).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.72",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.72"
            ]
          }
